questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a Spring Boot microservice handling high-throughput asynchronous PDF generation experiences a slow, steady increase in heap usage, eventually resulting in a `java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space`. A junior developer submitted the following implementation for context propagation:

java
@Service
public class ReportProcessingService {
    private static final ThreadLocal<Map<String, Object>> contextHolder = new ThreadLocal<>();

    @Async
    public void processReport(ReportRequest request) {
        Map<String, Object> ctx = contextHolder.get();
        if (ctx == null) {
            ctx = new HashMap<>();
            contextHolder.set(ctx);
        }
        ctx.put("requestId", request.getId());
        ctx.put("payload", request.getData());

        generatePdf(request);
    }
}
